{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Reject hosts that cannot advertise the local carrier**\n\nWith a supported core 2.4\u20132.6, `InvocationInfo` can never contain `xRayTraceId`, so this branch always accepts `_X_AMZN_TRACE_ID`. On Managed Instances that process-wide value can belong to a prior invocation, attributing spans to another execution's trace. Require core 2.7+ for this release and dynamic providers, or add a versioned capability handshake and fail closed when the host cannot distinguish an absent carrier from an old core.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs79-7AO","finding_digest":"7e75ebf10d41d9647a91b0f12c7a68203adaac2222feb9b1ce37ec5b543a20d5","finding_id":"arf_v1_pz26x4inihmwi6urwdysy6tiea","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/package.json::core-peer::layer-host-compatibility-enforcement","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/package.json::core-peer::layer-host-compatibility-enforcement","line":212,"observation_digest":"53f9d738a3e35aca653187619826c623b4ae0db6c9cfce1d49ad2639f9d68cdf","observation_id":"aro_v1_kp45oofd4nnmuzjrq5qzqjwgeo","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/context-extractors.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_pz26x4inihmwi6urwdysy6tiea","published_at":"2026-10-13T16:14:12Z","review_id":"arr_v1_rs5x2cdprwu4lmc5tbf2arojzb","reviewed_base_sha":"571858c7fe344824427303b51f4f673fe7467c91","reviewed_head_sha":"e26d29a7e74949f8c6893d3a61129ddcde7d7ce5","reviewer":"codex","start_line":210,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":955},"record_id":"art_v1_lr6azpn5poy2yulsx36wrrdeni","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-13T16:14:12Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
